    "description": {
      "value": "\n<h2>Greatsword</h2>\n<p>Coral's enormous two-handed blade. It rewards committing to a heavy swing rather than rapid attacks.</p>\n<h3>Charged Slash</h3>\n<p>If you do not move before making the attack, you can commit to a charged swing dealing 4d6 slashing damage.</p>\n<h3>Shoulder Tackle</h3>\n<p>Reaction: roll 1d8 + Strength modifier and reduce incoming physical damage by that amount.</p>\n",
